#
# OntoUML metamodel model — the StereotypeCardinality anti-pattern (documented in
# the OntoUML anti-pattern catalogue at
# https://ontouml.readthedocs.io/en/latest/anti-patterns/).
#
# Every OntoUML class carries exactly one stereotype. ex:Thing carries TWO
# (kind and role), so it violates the discipline. The documented verdict is
# StereotypeCardinality.

@prefix ontouml: <https://w3id.org/ontouml#> .
@prefix ex:      <https://gmeow.example/ontouml-mini/stereotype-cardinality/> .

ex:Thing a ontouml:Class ;
    ontouml:stereotype ontouml:kind ,
                       ontouml:role .
